WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.230
OK, let's talk a little bit about Tara Reid.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.650
Tara Reid is the woman who accused Joe Biden
of sexual assault.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.780
Now, I'm not here to evaluate her claims to
play tit for tat to debunk things.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.820
I'm getting a lot of emails from people saying,
David, I need you to go through the evidence.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.490
Did she do it or didn't she did did she do
it?

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.520
Meaning did she filed a complaint or didn't
she filed a complaint?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.020
Did Biden do it or did he not do it?

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:30.520
I'm not able to do that, and nor do I think
it's the appropriate thing to do.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:34.719
What I am here to tell you is from a political
standpoint, in terms of figuring out what

00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:38.589
you're going to do in November, if you are
someone who is debating what to do in November

00:00:38.589 --> 00:00:44.440
on the basis of the terror Reid situation,
there is never going to be a conclusive investigation

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.739
that tells us what happened.

00:00:45.739 --> 00:00:49.579
OK, we you all need to understand this and
you're going to have to figure out what to

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:53.979
do in November without a conclusion from an
investigation.

00:00:53.979 --> 00:00:58.450
And the reason that it's not going to happen
is that it essentially cannot happen, given

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.450
what we know.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.489
I mean, explain what I mean in a moment.

00:01:01.489 --> 00:01:06.390
The reason this is important is that a lot
of people who don't like Biden and don't like

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:12.970
Trump are now taking advantage of the terror
Reid story to essentially not have to make

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:17.790
a decision about whether voting for Biden
is better than voting for Trump.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:22.570
People who clearly are on Biden's side on
the issues or closer to Biden's side than

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:26.450
Trump's on the issues, are insisting that
until they know the truth about what happened

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:31.480
in the 1990s, until it's really investigated,
they can't decide.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.760
It's time to skip to the end.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.130
Any investigation that takes place based on
what's been made, what allegations have been

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:43.890
made so far would not tell you whether this
did or did not happen.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:44.890
It wouldn't.

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:52.690
This is not just about he said she said although
it it is this is not about believe women or

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:53.690
don't.

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:57.110
As I've said before, making allegations is
very serious.

00:01:57.110 --> 00:02:01.750
It exposes the victim to harassment and shame
and the whole thing.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:05.979
It must be taken seriously when a victim makes
an allegation.

00:02:05.979 --> 00:02:12.299
This is simply about all that I'm talking
about now is that there could not possibly

00:02:12.299 --> 00:02:16.370
be based on everything we know right now,
a conclusive investigation.

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:21.420
There's a bigger topic as well, which is can
someone prove they did not commit a sexual

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:26.650
assault when the allegations themselves are
like the ones we have here?

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:31.269
There's only a very narrow way that you could
prove you did not commit a sexual assault.

00:02:31.269 --> 00:02:37.129
And that would be like imagine that Terry
Reid filed a complaint on a specific day.

00:02:37.129 --> 00:02:40.630
And we saw, oh, the allegation is that this
supposedly took place.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:48.329
This day and then Bidens travel schedule from
that time shows he was out of the country.

00:02:48.329 --> 00:02:53.110
OK, maybe in that narrow scenario you could
conclude he didn't do it.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:58.760
But beyond that, you can't really prove you
didn't commit sexual assault.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.469
And in this particular case, we can't even
find the complaint.

00:03:02.469 --> 00:03:05.879
Biden said release certain records, but he
hasn't said release others.

00:03:05.879 --> 00:03:08.830
Tara Reid doesn't have a copy of the complaint.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.480
She previously said the complaint was for
sexual assault.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:17.310
Now she says the complaint she did file doesn't
mention sexual assault, but it describes sexual

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.319
harassment.

00:03:18.319 --> 00:03:20.280
But there's no copy of the complaint.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:24.840
So what I am telling you is not that she's
telling the truth or that she's lying.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.220
We should take her allegations seriously.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.739
But there is not a complaint to investigate.

00:03:29.739 --> 00:03:34.989
Joe Biden cannot prove his innocence, nor
is there any way to confirm Tara Reid's allegations.

00:03:34.989 --> 00:03:36.989
There couldn't be a conclusive investigation.

00:03:36.989 --> 00:03:41.980
Now, what about this idea that's floating
around that she was fired because of the complaint

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:43.459
that she filed?

00:03:43.459 --> 00:03:49.079
It's such a mess at this point that no investigation
could conclude anything.

00:03:49.079 --> 00:03:51.590
She says she was fired for filing the complaint.

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:56.250
We can't find there's a negative performance
review on file whose timing can be used to

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.450
call this into question.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.150
Well, what if you go and talk to witnesses?

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:04.290
Well, Terry Reid says she approached three
Biden aides about this back in the 90s.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:07.480
All three of those people told The New York
Times they don't know anything about it.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:08.670
Could they have forgotten?

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:09.670
Sure.

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:10.670
Could they be lying?

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:11.670
Sure.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:18.200
But the point is, it would be like the Cavenagh
investigation, where it is impossible to conclude

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.850
this happened or this didn't happen.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:27.290
Given that there is no way that an investigation
would ever tell us Biden did it or Biden didn't

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:32.380
do it, the message is you're going to have
to decide whether you prefer Trump or Biden

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.510
to be president.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:39.050
I think there are lots of people who would
love a way out of voting for Joe Biden and

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:47.310
would see Biden did it as a bailout, that
they need to feel okay about taking an action

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:49.290
that helps reelect Donald Trump.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:51.290
Listen, the DNC screwed itself.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.520
They selected a sexual assaulter.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.090
They lost my vote.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.360
But that investigation is not going to happen.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.280
And you're going to have to decide on the
issues.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.030
Now, does any of this clear, Biden?

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.530
Of course not.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:07.920
There's almost no way Biden could be cleared
again if it was determined that on the day

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.570
Tara Reid claims this happened, Biden was
in China.

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:14.060
That might clear him, but you'd still have
people say, oh, I'm sure Tara Regis doesn't

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:15.620
remember the right date.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:21.280
If the investigation determined as almost
every single one of these do, that it cannot

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:26.670
find evidence to confirm terror Reid story,
nor can it find evidence to disprove terror

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.120
Reid's story.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.850
People will read that as whatever they want.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:32.390
Either it happened, but there's not enough
evidence.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:36.750
Maybe because the evidence was suppressed,
people will come up with that or people will

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.470
say, see, I told you, there's no evidence
that this thing happened.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:44.720
It doesn't matter in the end because you are
going to need to decide.

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:49.970
Given that there will never be such a conclusion,
you will need to decide what is better for

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.720
the country in November.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.190
I'm not going to evangelize my point of view.

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:56.670
You all know the calculation I've made.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:06:03.180
You were going to have to make the same calculation
without the benefit of a conclusive investigation,

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.310
which there will never be.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:05.990
There may be an investigation.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.100
There is no way.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:11.440
Given what we know, that it would be conclusive
and give you the answer many of you are waiting

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:16.330
for.

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.530
You disagree.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:07:27.020
Let me know.

